#41002
"Hattiers Shop"
"A long table lies along the north wall, underneath an arching multi-paned

window.  Many utensils are scattered across the table, calipers, saws,

augers, and several you can't place.  Evenly placed about the room are

curious wooden stands, a long thin rod topped by a round ball.  A

veritable forest of plumes, feathers, caps, and helms top the stands. 

Passage east is blocked by a metal-banded, heavily locked door.

